{
  "_meta": {
    "purpose": "Cadence rows for the Make.com Processor (data store 108892). One row per campaign step. The Processor, on enrollment, walks a campaign's steps in order, waiting offset_hours (measured from the enrollment/trigger time) before POSTing the step to https://www.autolenis.com/api/crm/dispatch/email. is_last=true ends the cadence. See processor_request_spec for the exact dispatch contract.",
    "generated_for": "Supabase prod ref aieybibvewmvrubcpthm; every template_key below is verified present + active in email_templates.",
    "channel_note": "All seeded templates are email. SMS steps are sent inline via /api/crm/dispatch/sms (body, not template_key); add SMS rows here only once SMS bodies are authored.",
    "offset_semantics": "offset_hours is hours AFTER the enrollment/trigger event (delta from enrollment, not from the previous step). step 1 is typically offset 0 (immediate)."
  },
