  "processor_request_spec": {
    "method": "POST",
    "url": "https://www.autolenis.com/api/crm/dispatch/email",
    "headers": {
      "content-type": "application/json",
      "x-autolenis-signature": "hex( HMAC_SHA256(CRM_DISPATCH_SECRET, <exact raw request body bytes>) )",
      "x-autolenis-timestamp": "<unix ms at send time>",
      "x-idempotency-key": "<campaign>:<step>:<contactId> (stable per logical send; REQUIRED — 400 if absent)"
    },
    "body": {
      "contactId": "<CRM contacts.id uuid from the inbound event envelope>",
      "templateKey": "<template_key for this step>",
      "type": "marketing",
      "scenarioId": "<campaign>:<step>",
      "vars": { "firstName": "<from contact>", "dashboardUrl": "https://www.autolenis.com/dashboard" }
    },
    "notes": [
      "AutoLenis owns consent/suppression/quiet-hours/idempotency/audit — Make never sends email itself.",
      "type:'marketing' forces the consent gate; transactional confirmations (vr_received, auction_live, deal_formed, deposit_confirmed, contract_signed) may use type:'transactional' ONLY if their template_key is on the dispatch allowlist (lib/crm/email-dispatch-policy.ts), otherwise they collapse to marketing.",
      "Auth alternative for the no-code HTTP module: header x-dispatch-key: <CRM_DISPATCH_KEY> (static). HMAC (x-autolenis-signature) is preferred.",
      "A marketing send is BLOCKED (status:'blocked', reason:'physical_address_unconfigured') unless AUTOLENIS_PHYSICAL_ADDRESS is set to a real address in Vercel — set it before go-live."
    ]
  },
